@TrustVault.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5106

### Register a Viewer account
POST {{TrustVault.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new-user@example.test",
  "password": "ReplaceWithStrongPassword123!"
}

###

### Sign in
POST {{TrustVault.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new-user@example.test",
  "password": "ReplaceWithStrongPassword123!"
}

###

GET {{TrustVault.Api_HostAddress}}/api/system/health
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{TrustVault.Api_HostAddress}}/api/system/whoami
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
